      "beat_id": "NB03",
      "act": "2 WRONG GUESS",
      "narration_text": "It's tempting to think that's just a smarter prompt — more detail stuffed into the same conversation. But a prompt can't log into your CRM, add a slash-command shortcut to your menu, or hand a multi-step job to a coordinating subagent. A plugin does all three.",
