    {
      "beat_id": "NB09",
      "act": "4 ANCHOR PAYOFF",
      "narration_text": "Back to that friend and the accountant. It's the difference between asking a well-read friend what to watch for in a contract, and asking someone who reviews contracts for a living. That's the whole reason a plugin is worth your time.",
