    {
      "beat_id": "NB11",
      "act": "3 mechanism",
      "narration_text": "Out of the box, the sales plugin is useful. Configured with your process, your qualifying criteria, your positioning, it's dramatically more powerful. Customization is the next chapter — and that's where the real gain shows up.",
